7745431863425"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Researchers identified age-associated differences in tumor composition and gene activity, creating a foundation for investigating why colorectal cancer can be more aggressive in younger adults.", "display_url": "broad.io/single-cell-co…", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://broad.io/single-cell-colorectal", "images": [{"height": 1192, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115787755200372736/TUt-VIxM?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115787755200372736/TUt-VIxM?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 243, "status": 200, "title": "Study reveals distinct cellular and genetic differences in colorectal cancer in younger patients", "unwound_url": "https://www.broadinstitute.org/news/study-reveals-distinct-cellular-and-genetic-differences-colorectal-cancer-younger-patients", "url": "https://t.co/q8fmiWYjhS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/EPRImWV9vu", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/broadinstitute/status/2115787745431863425/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115787645418651648", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/EPRImWV9vu"}]}, "id": "2115787745431863425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2611, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "More people younger than 50 are being diagnosed with colorectal cancer, and the disease is often more aggressive. A single-cell study of colorectal tumors reveals differences in cell composition and expression in tumors from younger patients. https://t.co/q8fmiWYjhS https://t.co/EPRImWV9vu", "url": "https://x.com/broadinstitute/status/2115787745431863425"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:35:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115784481365713147"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Energy innovation has a commercialisation problem - A commentary by Jules Parfouru, Leonardo Paoli, Simon Bennett, Araceli Fernandez 