ow what would have been great for American manufacturing investment? NOT repealing key policies that lowered taxes for the US solar, wind and EV sectors. https://t.co/6B15Cu1Qva", "url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2115781915697438865"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:02:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115731023539417458"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "What explains the cost advantage of Chinese electrolysers? - A commentary by Herib Blanco, Uwe Remme, Timur Gül", "display_url": "iea.li/3TXbutg", "end": 287, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/3TXbutg", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115731072109465600/Cla0XHPt?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115731072109465600/Cla0XHPt?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 264, "status": 200, "title": "What explains the cost advantage of Chinese electrolysers? - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/commentaries/what-explains-the-cost-advantage-of-chinese-electrolysers?utm_content=bufferc31bf&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/xcQi8k24x4"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/YJvCiIvRuX", "end": 311, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2115731023539417458/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115731020691456000", "start": 288, "url": "https://t.co/YJvCiIvRuX"}]}, "id": "2115731023539417458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 2484, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "China is the global leader in electrolysis – home to nearly 70% of manufacturing capacity &amp; the world’s lowest capital costs for electrolysers\n \nOur commentary explores what’s behind this competitive edge, its limits &amp; the implications for global markets: https://t.co/xcQi8k24x4 https://t.co/YJvCiIvRuX", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2115731023539417458"}, {"author_id": "19386622", "created_at