$180 billion (US$5.5B) 30-years ago when the Taiwan Semiconductor Industry Association was founded, said TSIA Chair Cliff Hou. $TSM $UMC", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2115725083797033297"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-29T08:37:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115724790158045521"], "id": "2115724790158045521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 6716, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "TSMC paid NT$38.8 billion (US$1.2 billion) for two plants from AUO, media report, citing AUO Chair Paul Peng on the company’s 3rd quarter call. AUO’s board has already approved the sale of the two display panel plants, one 5th generation and one Gen-7.5. The sale includes some", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2115724790158045521"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-29T07:42:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115710814598635769"], "id": "2115710814598635769", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 4579, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Samsung Electronics raised its 2026 semiconductor capex plan to ₩76.8 trillion won (US$53 billion), from ₩47.5 trillion last year ($33.4 billion) amid strong AI-related demand expected to continue for years, executives said during its 3rd quarter conference. ₩52.8T has already", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2115710814598635769"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:50:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115607056904491216"], "id": "2115607056904491216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 5809, "like_count": 46, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "The CEO of UMC, Taiwan’s 2nd biggest chip foundry, said its blended average selling price will rise about 10% in 2027 and he expects a utilization rate over 90%, media report, adding AI will reach 25% of revenue within 3-years. UMC set its 2026 capex plan at US$2 billion, but the", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2115607056904491216"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:49:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115606838809186727"], "id": "2115606838809186727", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 6164, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "TSMC is nearing a deal with AUO to buy up to 4 plants to convert for CoWoS advanced packaging, media report, citing unnamed supply chain sources. TSMC has sent multiple teams to inspect AUO plants in the Central Taiwan Science Park and is expected to ink a deal for 2 plants and a", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2115606838809186727"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:01:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115564640545735051"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KldTkmAp3a", "end": 220, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2115564640545735051/video/1", "media_key": "13_2115564277109264384", "start": 197, "url": "https://t.co/KldTkmAp3a"}]}, "id": "2115564640545735051", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 40, "impression_count": 58766, "like_count": 380, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 32, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "People are calling it the worst take of all time. \n\n\"Bryan Johnson is the greatest social media player of all time. He is the Michael Jordan of social media.\" \n\nThank you Shaan for the kind words. https://t.co/KldTkmAp3a", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2115564640545735051"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "17468569", "name": "Bryan Johnson", "username": "bryan_johnson"}, {"id": "325581008", "name": "NRC", "username": "NRCgov"}, {"id": "166252256", "name": "U.S. Department of Energy", "username": "ENERGY"}, {"id": "84679163", "name": "International Energy Agency", "username": "IEA"}, {"id": "17026589", "name": "Jesse D. Jenkins", "username": "JesseJenkins"}, {